* Differential Pair Circuit

VIN 5 0 DC 0
VICM 1 0 DC vicm

* Transistors
M1 6 5 4 4 NMOS
M2 3 1 4 4 NMOS

* Resistors
RD1 6 0 RD
RD2 3 0 RD
RSS 4 0 RSS

* Outputs
VO1 6 0 DC vo1
VO2 3 0 DC vo2

* Connections
* Node 1 connects to gate of Q2 (M2)
* Node 3 connects to drain of Q2 (M2)
* Node 4 connects to source of Q1 (M1) and Q2 (M2)
* Node 5 connects to gate of Q1 (M1)
* Node 6 connects to drain of Q1 (M1)

